// DevtoolsTelemetryPanel.rs:1-2050. One typed, bounded observation model.
// Integration: core.devtools.runtime.kernel_devtools_telemetry_panel; no new envelope.
// Queue iteration/indexing below requires retaining read/mutable element loans
// (#4500). Never replace these with cloned get()/to_list() or an array queue.
// Protocol constructors belong ONLY to packet 0176's devtools runtime owner.
